.TH SSGRID 1 2000-1月 "sgrid_prior" "sgrid_prior"
.SH NAME
sgrid_prior \- read the prior knowledge regulatory network from a csv table or a data.frame
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIsgrid_prior(\fBdata\fR as any, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
read the prior knowledge regulatory network from a csv table or a data.frame
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBdata\fB \fR\- 
 a csv file path, or a data.frame object which contains the columns of 
 \fBtf,target,type,confidence,evidence\fR(the column name is case insensitive, 
 and the \fBconfidence\fR column could be a numeric score or the 
 \fBHigh/Medium/Low\fR label).
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- -. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [PriorNetwork](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.BioSystem.Core.PriorNetwork) object, or a R# error message object.
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
let prior = sgrid_prior("/data/TF_target_prior_curated.csv");
 let prior = sgrid_prior(data.frame(tf = ..., target = ..., type = ..., confidence = ...));
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
ssGrid
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
